MODULE IRAM32K

IMPORT RAM32K
IMPORT MUX
IMPORT COUNTER
IMPORT REGISTER1BIT

INPUT IN[16]
INPUT LOAD
INPUT RESET
INPUT ADDR[15]
INPUT POWER

CLOCK CLK

LOW ZERO
HIGH ONE

OUTPUT OUT[16]

OUTPUT ROUT

WIRE ZERO16[16]
OUTPUT COUNTEROUT[16]
OUTPUT COMPARATOROUT

SPLIT ADDR A0 A1 A2 A3 A4 A5 A6 A7 A8 A9 AA AB AC AD AE

JOIN ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO ZERO16

COUNTER C1 ZERO16 ZERO POWER ONE CLK COUNTEROUT
SPLIT COUNTEROUT K0 K1 K2 K3 K4 K5 K6 K7 K8 K9 KA KB KC KD KE KF

AND G1 K7 ONE TEMP1
AND G2 K8 ONE TEMP2
AND G3 K9 ONE TEMP3
AND G4 KA ONE TEMP4
AND G5 KB ONE TEMP5
AND G6 KC ONE TEMP6
AND G7 KD ONE TEMP7
AND G8 KE ONE TEMP8
AND G9 KF ONE TEMP9

AND G10 TEMP1 TEMP2 TEMP10
AND G11 TEMP3 TEMP4 TEMP11
AND G12 TEMP5 TEMP6 TEMP12
AND G13 TEMP7 TEMP8 TEMP13

AND G14 TEMP9 TEMP10 TEMP14
AND G15 TEMP11 TEMP12 TEMP15
AND G16 TEMP13 TEMP14 TEMP16
AND G17 TEMP15 TEMP16 COMPARATOROUT

REGISTER1BIT R2 COMPARATOROUT COMPARATOROUT POWER CLK ROUT

MUX M0 RESET ZERO ROUT MUXOUT
MUX M1 A0 K7 MUXOUT S0
MUX M2 A1 K8 MUXOUT S1
MUX M3 A2 K9 MUXOUT S2
MUX M4 A3 KA MUXOUT S3
MUX M5 A4 KB MUXOUT S4
MUX M6 A5 KC MUXOUT S5
MUX M7 A6 KD MUXOUT S6
MUX M8 A7 KE MUXOUT S7
MUX M9 A8 KF MUXOUT S8

JOIN S0 S1 S2 S3 S4 S5 S6 S7 S8 A9 AA AB AC AD AE ADDR

RAM32K R3 IN LOAD RESET ADDR CLK OUT
